      },
      "lineNbr": 1580,
      "author": {
        "id": 8341
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-08-18T19:39:16Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "`preConcat` should be checking if the incoming matrix is identity or not, so you could always just concat shader-\u003elocalMatrix() onto matrix, and then the if for skipping the LM block is simpler.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1580,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 1580,
        "endChar": 70
      },
      "revId": "21d48533f71eb34b9d9ad531e94da9f6bb37e316",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "4dc626d6_dfb77b99",
        "filename": "src/gpu/graphite/KeyHelpers.cpp",
        "patchSetId": 2
      },
      "lineNbr": 1581,
      "author": {
        "id": 8341
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-08-18T19:39:16Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think this needs to be postConcat since we\u0027re before the inverse local matrix is calculated.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1581,
        "startChar": 15,
        "endLine": 1581,
        "endChar": 24
      },
      "revId": "21d48533f71eb34b9d9ad531e94da9f6bb37e316",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "220a1f2c_e71a39d5",
        "filename": "src/gpu/graphite/KeyHelpers.cpp",
        "patchSetId": 2
      },
      "lineNbr": 1581,
      "author": {
        "id": 5036
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-08-18T21:00:00Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think preConcat is right...\n\nIn the end dont we want (inv flip is same as flip):\n\n`[inv local matrix] * [flip matrix] * [cord]`.\n\nSo since this is before we invert the matrix uniform we want:\n`[flip matrix] * [local matrix]`\n\nThus I want to preConcat the local matrix onto my flip matrix here right, or have I confused the these matrices again?",
      "parentUuid": "4dc626d6_dfb77b99",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1581,
        "startChar": 15,
        "endLine": 1581,
        "endChar": 24
      },
      "revId": "21d48533f71eb34b9d9ad531e94da9f6bb37e316",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "3957c77b_b76ae8c8",
        "filename": "src/gpu/graphite/KeyHelpers.cpp",
        "patchSetId": 2
      },
      "lineNbr": 1581,
      "author": {
        "id": 8341
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-08-18T21:11:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "`localMatrix` goes from the child\u0027s coordinate space to the parent (or at the root, the true geometric local space). The flip matrix goes from the logical image view\u0027s space to the true texture coordinates, so we want `[tex coord] \u003d [flip matrix] * [parent -\u003e child] * [coord]`, and `parent-\u003echild` is the inverse local matrix.\n\n`(flip*invLocal)^-1` is `local * flip`. Since `matrix` holds `flip`, we need postConcat to put `localMatrix` on the left hand side.",
      "parentUuid": "220a1f2c_e71a39d5",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1581,
        "startChar": 15,
        "endLine": 1581,
        "endChar": 24
      },
      "revId": "21d48533f71eb34b9d9ad531e94da9f6bb37e316",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
    {
