      "writtenOn": "2023-08-18T19:39:16Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We could just replace this with `static_cast\u003cconst SkImageShader*\u003e(t.get())`. We shouldn\u0027t need to call `as_SB` and I don\u0027t particularly feel like having another variable for the SkImageShader adds much.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 39,
        "startChar": 33,
        "endLine": 39,
        "endChar": 42
      },
      "revId": "21d48533f71eb34b9d9ad531e94da9f6bb37e316",
